c22f5d51-4019-452b-b4f2-b495ee86989e	tg:495185511	assistant	```python\ndef factorial(n):\n    if n < 0:\n        return "مش موجود لـ negative numbers"\n    if n == 0 or n == 1:\n        return 1\n    return n * factorial(n - 1)\n```\n\nجرب كده:\n\n```python\nprint(factorial(5))  # 120\nprint(factorial(0))  # 1\n```\n\nعايزها iterative عشان الميموري ولا كده ماشية؟ 🤔	{}	2026-06-25 00:31:34.855029+00
