c64ba1bb-ed94-4a5b-8e96-16442aae908c	tg:495185511	assistant	إليك دالة بايثون تقرأ ملف CSV وتجمع قيم عمود معين:\n\nimport csv\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n\ndef sum_column(file_path, column_name, cast=float, delimiter=None):\n    total = cast(0)\n    path = Path(file_path)\n\n    if not path.exists():\n        raise FileNotFoundError(path)\n\n    with path.open(newline='', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        if delimiter:\n            reader = csv.DictReader(f, delimiter=delimiter)\n        else:\n            reader = csv.DictReader(f)\n\n        for row in reader:\n            value = row.get(column_name)\n\n            if value is None or value == '':\n                continue\n\n            try:\n                total += cast(value)\n            except ValueError:\n                pass\n\n    return total\n\n\n# مثال:\n# result = sum_column('data.csv', 'amount')\n# print(result)	{}	2026-09-21 20:54:53.773264+00
